# GitHub Linguist hints — keep language stats honest.
#
# Everything under web/public/<vendored-lib>/ is third-party code we
# ship verbatim from npm packages (libass-wasm / SubtitlesOctopus,
# libav.js, hevc.js, libpgs). Without these markers, Linguist sums
# their ~8 MB of minified JS / WebAssembly into our totals and tags
# the repo as "JavaScript".
web/public/libass/**     linguist-vendored
web/public/libavjs/**    linguist-vendored
web/public/hevcjs/**     linguist-vendored
web/public/libpgs/**     linguist-vendored

# Lockfiles aren't authored code. Linguist treats most of these as
# `linguist-generated` via its defaults, but pin them explicitly so
# a future Linguist update can't surprise us.
Cargo.lock               linguist-generated
web/bun.lock             linguist-generated
